      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Chordoma is a rare malignant tumor demonstrating notochordal differentiation [1]. It almost invariably arises in the axial skeleton however rare examples of primary extra-axial chordomas have been reported [2-5]. We describe herein, for the first time, a primary conventional chordoma arising in the synovium of the knee joint. This article is protected by copyright. All rights reserved."
